            "id": 2965,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, both genders showed an increasing trend toward daily social media use over the period. By 2014, daily usage had become the most common pattern for both men and women, with women demonstrating consistently higher engagement rates than their male counterparts.</p>",
            "question_id": 40525,
            "is_toggle_on": true
